  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 6 and takes 30 minutes to prepare and 35 minutes to bake at 180C. Pastilla au Lait is a Moroccan dessert pie of crisp buttered pastry filled with a set milk cream, topped with toasted almonds and dusted with icing sugar and cinnamon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: This recipe uses rose water, but the traditional version typically uses "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "orange-blossom"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "orange blossom water"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for its floral, slightly citrusy note. If you can find it at a Middle Eastern or North African grocer, use it in place of the rose water in equal measure."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
